<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>$(DEVELOPMENT_LANGUAGE)</string>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>Dayday</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
	<string>6.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>APPL</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>$(MARKETING_VERSION)</string>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>$(CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION)</string>
	<key>LSApplicationCategoryType</key>
	<string>public.app-category.productivity</string>
	<key>LSMinimumSystemVersion</key>
	<string>$(MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET)</string>
	<key>LSMultipleInstancesProhibited</key>
	<true/>
	<key>LSUIElement</key>
	<true/>
	<key>NSHighResolutionCapable</key>
	<true/>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Dayday 仅在你开始编辑日记时自动记录一次位置，或在你手动更新位置、启用天气时读取前台当前位置。日记位置会作为私有记录保存，并带有系统给出的精度；不会后台追踪或用于工作日报。</string>
	<key>NSCalendarsFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Dayday 仅以只读方式读取您允许的日历事件，用于在工作时间线和日报中展示日程上下文；不会创建、修改或删除事件。</string>
	<key>NSRemindersFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Dayday 仅以只读方式读取您允许的提醒事项，用于在工作时间线和日报中展示待办上下文；不会创建、修改或删除提醒。</string>
	<key>NSScreenCaptureUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Dayday 仅在您明确启用屏幕理解后短暂分析可见工作上下文，用于生成工作时间线和日报；原始分辨率画面默认不会保存。</string>
	<key>NSListenEventUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Dayday 仅在您启用键盘/鼠标/触控板聚合并点击请求后，读取本地输入事件的粗粒度统计（按键次数、点击次数、滚动量），用于洞察页展示；绝不保存输入内容或输入顺序。</string>
	<key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Dayday 仅在你主动完成 iPhone 配对后，于同一 Wi-Fi 下加密接收你授权的健康事实；不会连接互联网或上传健康数据。</string>
	<key>NSBonjourServices</key>
	<array>
		<string>_dayday-health._tcp</string>
	</array>
	<key>NSHumanReadableCopyright</key>
	<string>Copyright © 2026 Dayday contributors.</string>
</dict>
</plist>
